# oracle: 27 FENE dimers (bond_style fene, bond_coeff 1 30 1.5 1 1, special_bonds fene) under fix shake on the bonds: SHAKE holds each bond at the style's equilibrium distance, which native BondFENE gives as 0.97 sigma (not R0); WCA pairs, NVE 20 steps
# oracle-inputs: w255pw_fene_shake.data
# Measured max relative error, engine vs native (thermo rows, final atoms): thermo 1.7e-12, atoms 3.3e-10. Before the fix (the engine took R0 = 1.5 as the fene equilibrium) the pressure missed native at step 0 (1.98 against 2.53).
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all
units           lj
atom_style      bond
boundary        p p p
read_data       w255pw_fene_shake.data
bond_style      fene
bond_coeff      1 30.0 1.5 1.0 1.0
special_bonds   fene
pair_style      lj/cut 1.122462048309373
pair_coeff      1 1 1.0 1.0
pair_modify     shift yes
velocity        all create 1.0 4928459 loop geom
fix             1 all nve
fix             2 all shake 0.0001 50 0 b 1
compute         bl all bond/local dist
compute         bmax all reduce max c_bl inputs local
compute         bmin all reduce min c_bl inputs local
timestep        0.002
thermo_style    custom step temp pe ebond epair press c_bmax c_bmin
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
thermo          5
run             20
